# Title -> name entry -> type a name and confirm -> the dialog -> main menu -> a sub-menu and
# back. Single-row wheel gestures (8 detents) separated by enough frames to stay deterministic.
200: select
260: wheel +240
330: wheel +240
400: wheel +240
500: select
740: select
1040: select
1300: shot
1340: wheel +16
1500: shot
1600: select
1900: shot
2000: select
2300: shot
2400: wheel +8
2600: select
2900: shot
3000: menu
3300: shot
3400: wheel +8
3600: select
3900: shot
4000: menu
4300: shot
4300: quit
